  day: 1
  text: "Morning\u2026 Ah you\u2019re whats-his-face. Sorry, bumped my head a lot
    yesterday and seems something broke in my noggin. Now, you\u2019re new. So I
    won\u2019t hold yesterday\u2019s decisions against you. But this will be a lot
    easier for the both of us if you just listen to me. I said I wanted to go to
    A2. You send me to A2. That way, you and I\u2019ll be friends. Trust me, you
    want me as a friend."
